{
  "name": "anima_ref_turbo",
  "display_name": "Anima Turbo + reference",
  "description": "Anima Turbo with ArcAnima's Anima Reference Adapter: the reference image's character in the prompt's scene, fast.",
  "prompt_guide": "This tool draws the one character in a reference image in a new scene. The reference gives who is drawn: face, hair, eyes, outfit and accessories, and much of the drawing style. The prompt gives everything else: framing, pose, action, expression, place, time and light.\nPrompts MUST follow this order:\n\nmasterpiece, best quality, score_7, safe, 1girl (or 1boy), solo, [framing], [pose and action], [expression], [place, time and light]\n\nSwap safe for the rating that fits (sensitive, nsfw, explicit).\nNEVER write an @artist tag here, unlike generate_illustrated_image: the reference sets the style. Don't name the character or its series, and leave out hair, eye and outfit tags: the reference gives them (a few appearance tags are fine when something must change, such as a jacket taken off). Use a LoRA trigger listed below only when the user asks for that style or concept.\nOne character per image: always solo, and the reference must show one character.\nAsk for a pose or framing that differs from the reference's: the model is trained not to copy the reference's pose, and a clear pose in the prompt helps. Parts the reference doesn't show (legs in a bust-up, the back of an outfit) are guessed; a reference showing the whole character gives more consistent outfits.\nUse booru-style tags with spaces, NOT underscores (e.g. 'looking at viewer'). Text later in the prompt has MORE effect.{lora_triggers}\n\nSmall details of the reference (earrings, scars, small patterns) are often lost, and strongly painterly styles carry over less than the character does.",
  "tool_name": "generate_from_reference",
  "is_default": true,
  "family": "anima_ref",
  "lora_group": "anima",
  "lora_strengths_from": "anima_turbo",
  "negative_fixed": "worst quality, low quality, score_1, score_2, score_3, blurry, jpeg artifacts, watermark, signature",
